"所有** 销售线索，无论其状态是赢得/丢失，或活跃/不活跃。这样就能全面了解分配给"
"每个销售成员的所有潜在客户。"

#: ../../content/applications/sales/crm/track_leads/lead_distribution_report.rst:147
#: ../../content/applications/sales/rental/rental_orders/rental_order_dashboard.rst:100
msgid "Group by"
